        "original_id": "d308b433-24b0-542f-a6b5-c2b9298d5468",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steve Sekely, King Baggot, Gail Patrick, Nancy Kelly\n- Works: Women in Bondage\n- Concepts: alternate names, publicity titles, film directing, film starring\n\nFacts:\n- Steve Sekely was born Székely István and was known by several names, including Stefan Szekely, reflecting changes in his professional and immigration status.\n- King Baggot was the first individually publicized leading man in America.\n- King Baggot was referred to as \"King of the Movies,\" \"The Most Photographed Man in the World,\" and \"The Man Whose Face Is As Familiar As The Man In The Moon.\"\n- Women in Bondage was directed by Steve Sekely.\n- Women in Bondage starred Gail Patrick and Nancy Kelly.",
